msgid "Lostlink – 404 Monitor & Smart Redirects"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: lostlink.php
msgid "Finds the broken URLs that cost you visitors, ranks them by priority and fixes them with the right 301 redirect in one click."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the plugin
#: lostlink.php
msgid "elfifou"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin.php:96
msgid "When you visit an address of this site that does not exist (a \"404\" error), this address, the date and the address of the page you came from, if your browser sends it, are recorded to find and fix the broken links. No IP address, browser identifier or cookie is recorded. The addresses of the pages you came from are deleted after 90 days without a new visit, unless the site settings say otherwise."
